      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MARCOS (5) was outclassed in Open grade two back before winning in a photo at Belmont most recently. He's still working through the grades nicely and the form has already been franked. Remains in the same grade as his last start win and can repeat the dose in this suitable assignment. STYLIN' (6) missed narrowly two back as an odds-on pop before a 5.5L defeat most recently. Faithfull hops back on board and she's a third-up winner in the past. Tougher now, but her best form is good enough to win a race like this. TOO DARN STORMY (1) has been racing over 1000m to begin this campaign but he's open to plenty of improvement now out to 1300m. The inside draw should see him get every chance and with improvement in store, he makes plenty of appeal. TACITO (4) is not to be discounted on his recent form. SCOTTISH LAIRD (2) gets the winkers replacing the blinkers and won't be far away.",
